WEBVTT

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.740
Hop, step, jump.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.640
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:00:21.640 --> 00:00:23.450
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:24.900
Who I wanna be.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:36.150
They call me calm, strong, and cool.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:40.500
Everyone says I'm popular.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.910
But the truth is, I'm not like that at all.

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:47.120
I'm just an ordinary girl!

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:51.230
I wish I could just get rid

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:55.010
of all this pressure and be myself.

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.850
But they'd all say it's out of character.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:01:03.260
Unlock my heart!

00:01:04.070 --> 00:01:08.610
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:11.460
Your Guardian Characters are with you.

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:15.710
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.780
It'll be okay, really!

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.690
Just be who you wanna be.

00:01:23.690 --> 00:01:26.460
Having only one style would be way too boring.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:30.720
Just do it the way you wanna do it.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.990
You can do anything!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:36.610
I know that...

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:38.450
Hop, step, jump.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:40.340
Drew, draw, drawn.

00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:42.210
Chip, syrup, whip.

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.520
...is who I wanna be.

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.200
Now...

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.260
When you think of New Year's...

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.760
You think of this!

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:01.230
New Year's moneys!

00:02:01.230 --> 00:02:03.430
Oh, darling, you're so grand!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:05.020
Here you go, Ami-chan.

00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:06.060
Yay!

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.830
Tank you vewy much for the pwesent!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:10.660
So<i> cute!</i>

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.250
Here's yours, Amu-chan.

00:02:13.930 --> 00:02:16.250
Hooray! New Year's money!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.510
Thanks.

00:02:18.510 --> 00:02:19.720
That's my Amu-chan;

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.830
super cool!

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:23.520
They're here.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:28.670
Happy New Year, Amu-chi!

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.180
Happy New Year.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:33.410
Happy New Year, Hinamori-san.

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:35.750
My prince...

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:41.790
A Guardian Character at the Ski Slope!? 
Snoppe's Appearance!

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:41.790
Episode 14

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:48.180
Please let me Character Transform with Amu-chan a lot.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:49.090
Same for me.

00:02:49.090 --> 00:02:50.830
Me, too.

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:56.630
Please let me get closer to Tadase-kun this year.

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:59.310
Um... And... And...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.330
Why am I thinking of him?

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:05.360
It's not like I have feelings for him.

00:03:05.360 --> 00:03:07.000
Um...

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:09.950
Hinamori-san, what did you pray for?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:10.590
What?

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.270
Not that!

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.920
Huh? Not what?

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:18.570
Oh, nothing, never mind!

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:22.250
Um, I'm sure I prayed for the same things as everyone else.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.630
You mean world domination?

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:26.440
World domination?

00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:29.390
No one but you would pray for that, Hotori-kun.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.470
Oh.

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.570
W-Well, world domination might be good, too.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.370
I got "great luck."

00:03:42.680 --> 00:03:44.390
Excellent, Tadase!

00:03:44.390 --> 00:03:46.060
Mine says "average luck."

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:48.180
Perhaps that is accurate.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:49.860
I got "great luck!"

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:51.200
Naturally-dechu!

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:53.570
Why did I get "bad luck?"

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:56.840
Ain't my fault! You're the one who drew it!

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:58.180
What did you get, Amu-chi?

00:03:58.180 --> 00:03:59.670
"Uncertain luck."

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.100
That's tough.

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:05.840
Well, cheer up, and let's go shopping.

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:09.400
That's right, we've got other preparations to make.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.530
No fair. I wish I could learn to snowboard, too!

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:16.790
Seiyo Elementary

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:16.790
Snowboarding School

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:16.680
Unfortunately, it's only for fifth and sixth-graders.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:18.180
Uncertain luck...

00:04:18.180 --> 00:04:21.310
I just know I'm going to fall.

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:24.460
Now, don't take your fortune too seriously.

00:04:24.460 --> 00:04:26.390
That's what you say, but...

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:31.180
Pardon me.

00:04:34.630 --> 00:04:37.620
From the expression on your face,

00:04:37.620 --> 00:04:40.740
it's obvious the Director's been chastising you for not finding the Embryo.

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:43.290
Don't get carried away with your delusions.

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:47.530
Ah, but he was just grumbling,

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:51.700
wondering when you'd be able to deliver the Embryo to the Boss.

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:55.330
You seem pretty relaxed.

00:04:55.330 --> 00:05:00.220
You're putting a lot of faith in that young girl, Hoshina Utau.

00:05:00.220 --> 00:05:02.210
What about those "Guardians?"

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:05.890
Those kids that are causing you such trouble are even younger than her.

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:06.700
You're one to talk.

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:14.890
Let's have a race to see which of us can present the Boss with the Embryo first.

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:16.960
A race, huh?

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.980
You're on.

00:05:22.310 --> 00:05:23.890
Excuse me.

00:05:36.020 --> 00:05:40.140
I don't think he's actually a bad guy.

00:05:40.850 --> 00:05:42.510
Amu-chan!

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.330
Huh?

00:05:44.290 --> 00:05:45.930
What were you thinking?

00:05:45.930 --> 00:05:47.890
Um, nothing.

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:49.520
Is it a secret?

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:51.640
I guess you could call it that.

00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:52.620
Sorry.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:55.060
No, it's okay.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:06:00.060
From the look on your face, I assumed it must be something very important.

00:06:00.660 --> 00:06:03.770
My face? What kind of face was I making?

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:07.310
I-It wasn't especially strange or anything. Don't worry.

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.330
You saying that makes me worry even more.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:14.330
A race, huh?

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.580
My methods thus far haven't been very efficient.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.250
I have to think of an alternative.

00:06:17.970 --> 00:06:18.870
Sensei!

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.160
Sensei!

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:24.730
W-What is it?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:28.210
Jeez. I just wanted to give you some snacks.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:32.600
Trying to look cool isn't like you, Sensei.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:36.360
Really? You think so?

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:43.660
And now it is time for me, Yamabuki Saya, the school's number one celebrity, to sing!

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:46.870
Ms. Tour Guide, the usual, if you please.

00:06:49.730 --> 00:06:51.390
"The usual?"

00:06:53.990 --> 00:06:57.490
The shadow of desire over the writhing city...

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.500
Yuck!

00:06:57.490 --> 00:07:00.730
...prowls about in an angel's guise.

00:06:57.500 --> 00:06:59.290
Sh-She's terrible.

00:07:00.730 --> 00:07:04.240
Cradling, as if precious, the shards...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.830
It's kind of artistic, in its own way.

00:07:04.240 --> 00:07:05.830
...of dreams that have no place left to go.

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:20.520
I wonder if I'll be any good at this.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:23.520
So do I. I'm good at skiing, but...

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:27.870
Hm, it looks like the instructor isn't here yet.

00:07:27.870 --> 00:07:32.480
The instructor who'll be teaching you all is one of Japan's best snowboarders;

00:07:32.480 --> 00:07:36.870
someone who will undoubtedly go on to win medals at the World Championships.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:38.410
World Championships?!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.710
And she's only 11!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:44.360
It's amazing to think that she's the same age as you guys.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.710
One of Japan's best at age 11?

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:47.810
No way!

00:07:47.810 --> 00:07:48.690
It's true!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:50.380
She's Tori Mifuyu-san!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.700
Whoa!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:53.060
Wow!

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:54.540
Who's that?

00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:55.870
Amu-chan.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.120
But I heard someone on TV say that she has a competition today.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:03.520
Yes, the preliminaries are today and the finals are tomorrow.

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:09.140
Tomorrow's winners will earn a spot on the World Championship team.

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:11.150
She's rather late, though.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:13.520
It's strange.

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:18.830
That was close! I almost froze to death!

00:08:19.370 --> 00:08:21.040
Um...

00:08:21.040 --> 00:08:22.330
Who are you?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:25.950
I'm Tori Mifuyu. Nice to meet you!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.870
Dazed

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:31.360
Huh? What's wrong?

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:33.520
Yet another weirdo...

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:37.750
That girl...

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:38.560
Yeah.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.440
Whoa!

00:08:57.440 --> 00:08:59.230
I knew I'd fall.

00:08:59.230 --> 00:09:00.980
Yahoo!

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.700
Hey, you guys! Help me up!

00:09:03.990 --> 00:09:05.810
This is fun!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:08.250
A-Aren't we going a bit too fast?

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:10.580
Good grief.

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.610
Okay-

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.570
What's your name?

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.150
Hinamori Amu.

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:24.020
Amu-chan, huh? That was a great fall! Nice form!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:25.810
What, my fall?

00:09:25.810 --> 00:09:30.920
Yep! If you're no good at falling, then you won't be any good at snowboarding.

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.420
The way you fall is great!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.080
She's kind of annoying.

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:38.500
Listen, when you turn, it's like this.

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.860
You go <i>swish!</i>

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:42.750
And then<i> swoosh!</i>

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:45.810
Swish and swoosh?

00:09:45.810 --> 00:09:47.800
Right! Good! Good!

00:09:47.800 --> 00:09:49.250
Really?

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:50.200
Good job!

00:09:57.380 --> 00:10:00.700
It looks like she can't see us.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.230
That means...

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:06.420
Her egg hasn't hatched yet.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:07.890
What do you mean?

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:11.100
That girl is about to give birth to an egg.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:13.400
A really strong one, too!

00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:14.580
What? Really?

00:10:15.810 --> 00:10:17.980
Amu-chan, are you a wierdo?

00:10:17.980 --> 00:10:19.840
You're talking to yourself.

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.820
Oh, no. That was nothing.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:23.930
Um, so Mifuyu-chan...

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:24.520
Oops.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:28.180
Yeah, it's okay if you call me that. Totally okay.

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.910
Jeez, don't you have prelims today?

00:10:33.910 --> 00:10:35.810
Should you be doing this?

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:37.570
Nothing to worry about.

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:40.590
Oh, yeah! You and your friends should come cheer me on.

00:10:40.590 --> 00:10:43.720
If I had some girls my own age like you cheering for me,

00:10:43.720 --> 00:10:45.560
it'd be like a super courage booster!

00:10:45.560 --> 00:10:47.210
Super courage booster?

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:51.450
That hurt...

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:56.580
That kid...

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.020
Could she have...

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:17.100
The first competition of the season has finally begun!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:20.560
And drawing considerable attention is Tori Mifuyu.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:26.580
That's right. The focus will be on how much of her technique will stand up in a competition against adults.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.680
Look, it's Mifuyu-chan!

00:11:28.680 --> 00:11:30.120
Yeah! Win this thing!

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.490
Tori is certainly popular with the kids.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.810
She's competing with adults,

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:38.850
so the children must be expecting great things from her.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:38.850
Oh, there's Hinamori-senpai!

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.110
Grandma, I have to record it!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.090
Our records are...

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:46.450
Right. Nice and round, and when you spin it...

00:11:46.450 --> 00:11:47.550
No!

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:49.360
Oh no, I won't make it!

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:52.470
I'll just have to record it in my heart.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:01.820
You're really amazing, to be getting so much attention.

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:04.190
Oh, no... I'm not that special.

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:09.010
We're rivals, but I'm really looking forward to watching your run.

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.970
Yeah, I expect good things.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:11.900
You expect...

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:14.660
This could be bad.

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:15.810
Huh?

00:12:15.810 --> 00:12:16.430
Oh no!

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.220
Hey!  Where are you going?!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.070
Huh? Hey, look over there.

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.100
Isn't that Tori-san?

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:24.620
I wonder what happened.

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.250
I'll go see.

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.670
You're really amazing.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:29.800
I expect good things.

00:12:29.800 --> 00:12:31.240
Oh no, oh no.

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.330
Oh no!

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.230
Man...

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.400
I did it again.

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:43.470
Why am I always like this?

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:46.750
I wish I wouldn't get all scared before a competition.

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:49.350
I want to become someone brave and courageous!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:51.530
Huh?

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:53.560
Is someone there?

00:12:53.560 --> 00:12:55.020
Was it just my imagination?

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:04.560
A-An egg?

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:05.520
Is that...

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:08.790
Why's there an egg?  Did I lay it?

00:13:08.790 --> 00:13:11.380
We didn't learn about this in Health class!

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:13.950
Calm down, I'll explain.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:17.430
You're Amu-chan, the one that's good at falling!

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.190
Don't remember me for that.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.480
Why can you explain about the egg?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.750
Because I've got a bit more experience with them than you do.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.170
More experience?

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.780
What do you mean?

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:34.110
The egg...

00:13:34.110 --> 00:13:34.720
It's hatching!

00:13:39.410 --> 00:13:41.460
It's nice to meet you.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.540
Uh, nice to meet you, too.

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:46.040
Please call me Snoppe.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.710
Okay, Snoppe.

00:13:48.710 --> 00:13:51.860
What? It talked!

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.860
Calm down, Mifuyu.

00:13:51.860 --> 00:13:52.850
How can I be calm?!

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:58.950
Character Change: From an emotional girl to one who's calm!

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:00.360
Character Change?!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.280
I'm calm.

00:14:06.270 --> 00:14:07.790
She's like...

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.240
So plain.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.390
So that's how she really is?

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:16.620
This is one of those "Guardian Characters" you were talking about?

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:20.310
Now that I look closely, it seems like you have Guardian Characters, too.

00:14:20.310 --> 00:14:24.090
They were born from my wishes.

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:28.310
Just like Snoppe was born from yours.

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:32.770
Haven't you always thought you'd like to change?

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.790
Now that you mention it...

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:39.940
I always get nervous right before a competition.

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:43.030
When I started thinking about everyone's expectations of me,

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:47.370
I suddenly got scared and ran away.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.910
If you believe in yourself,

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:52.240
your Guardian Character's strengths become your strengths.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:54.180
My...

00:14:54.180 --> 00:14:55.120
Strengths?

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:02.440
That's right, your strengths.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:07.240
But you have to believe in your Guardian Character, or it'll disappear.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:07.900
What?

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:10.950
We had a bit of a rough start.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.590
Amu-chan just wouldn't believe.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:16.090
Must you keep bringing that up?

00:15:16.090 --> 00:15:18.170
I wonder if I can do it.

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.520
You'll be fine.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:25.600
What's important is that you believe in Snoppe.

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:28.620
Right. If you do that, things will definitely be okay.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.300
I have to believe...

00:15:37.470 --> 00:15:39.270
I just have to believe!

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:45.830
Finally, Tori Mifuyu is next.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:50.360
Character Change: To a girl who isn't nervous.

00:15:50.360 --> 00:15:51.330
All right!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.480
It's started!

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.040
Go! Go!

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.850
This'll be good! I'm not nervous!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.020
Was that a Guardian Character?

00:16:09.020 --> 00:16:09.670
Amazing!

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.330
She's so cool!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:17.840
She really does have a powerful egg.

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:22.990
Guardian Characters are born from eggs with great power.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:26.730
If I can harness that power,

00:16:26.730 --> 00:16:27.890
then perhaps...

00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:31.290
All right!

00:16:36.620 --> 00:16:38.700
It's worth a try.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.000
Congratulations!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:46.640
It's all thanks to your support.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:48.630
You guys are all possessed by Guardian Characters!

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:50.040
Possessed?

00:16:50.040 --> 00:16:52.040
Don't make us sound like ghosts.

00:16:52.040 --> 00:16:52.970
That's rude!

00:16:52.970 --> 00:16:55.100
Oh, sorry.

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.780
My name is Temari.

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.750
Nice to meet you.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:05.890
Hey, doesn't it bother you guys to have these things around all the time?

00:17:05.890 --> 00:17:07.510
Do not speak of us as objects!

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.760
I thought that way at first.

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.460
They were kind of annoying.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.580
You, too?!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:15.110
But now we get along well!

00:17:15.110 --> 00:17:19.840
Well, since Guardian Characters are basically like your own dreams,

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:22.300
there's no reason to not get along.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:23.800
Oh.

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:25.590
Oh, Amu-chan!

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.790
To hear you say that...

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:31.020
I'm deeply moved!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:32.970
Shut it, you guys!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:35.880
She got mad!

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:38.530
Anyway, you're a fellow Character Bearer.

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:41.320
Feel free to ask us about anything that bothers you.

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.970
Okay, thank you.

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:45.580
For now, just do your best at the finals tomorrow.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.690
Stop! If you say stuff like that, it'll just make me nervous!

00:17:50.530 --> 00:17:52.970
You really do have stage fright.

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:58.280
When I think about what people expect from me, my body starts to tremble, like this.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.740
It's amazing that you made it this far.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:01.870
Soma-kun.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:02.970
No, it's okay.

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.810
I can't believe it, myself.

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:11.270
When I'm competing, my mind usually goes blank, and I only come to when it's over.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:16.820
But when your mind is blank, sometimes you do well, and sometimes you run away, right?

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.340
Very well. Loyal subjects!

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.270
You will now think of a way for her to overcome her nervousness!

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:23.460
Why's Kiseki giving orders?

00:18:23.460 --> 00:18:25.410
That's how it always is.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:26.680
I'm not totally sure about this,

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:30.850
but I've heard if you draw the character for "no" on your palm and then swallow it, it'll keep anxiety away.

00:18:30.850 --> 00:18:32.220
The character for "no," huh?

00:18:32.220 --> 00:18:34.430
It's not the character for "no," it's a spiral.

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.770
A spiral?

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:38.150
Don't you mean the character for "person?"

00:18:38.150 --> 00:18:41.270
I've heard you're supposed to hit yourself in the head with your fists.

00:18:41.270 --> 00:18:42.370
Like this?

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:44.900
That's it!

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.590
I'm getting the feeling things are gonna go well!

00:18:47.590 --> 00:18:50.400
All right! Now for a little practice!

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:50.400
Huh?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:51.970
Now?

00:18:56.720 --> 00:18:58.950
She's really practicing.

00:18:58.950 --> 00:19:02.310
She must be serious about getting a medal at the World Championships.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:05.740
Whoa!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.220
A-Are you all right?

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:09.500
I'm okay!

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:15.280
Thinking back, I fell a lot when I first started snowboarding.

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:17.220
You failed all the time, but...

00:19:19.590 --> 00:19:21.550
It was fun!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:28.300
You two will be my first test subjects.

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:41.670
I'm not nervous at all today!

00:19:41.670 --> 00:19:44.050
Looks like I'll be able to have my usual good run.

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.020
That's the way!

00:19:46.020 --> 00:19:47.990
Hello there!

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:52.000
Thanks for teaching my students yesterday.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:55.360
Not a problem. I had fun.

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:57.050
That's good.

00:19:57.050 --> 00:20:01.420
Oh, right... Please do your best and win today.

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:03.220
I will!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.490
It'd make my students very happy,

00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:11.010
and everyone in Japan is looking forward to seeing the youngest winner of all time.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:13.810
Everyone in Japan's looking forward...

00:20:13.810 --> 00:20:18.690
Yes. Of course, if you fail, I'm sure everyone will be very disappointed.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.520
Good thing you won't fail!

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:25.310
Because failing would be like betraying everyone.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.510
I'll be fine.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:33.660
The others taught me what to do.

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.450
I shouldn't be nervous.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.910
It's the top snowboarders' race of their dreams!

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.680
We're all anticipating how the competitors who passed yesterday's preliminaries will do today.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:46.020
Above all others, everyone expects Tori Mifuyu to do extremely well today.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:50.160
Mifuyu-chan, believe in me!

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:52.380
What'll I do if I fail?

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:53.790
Believe in me!

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:58.760
Everyone, don't expect anything of me!

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.000
If you don't believe in me, I'll...

00:21:01.000 --> 00:21:02.580
You're really amazing.

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:03.350
I expect good things.

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:04.660
Everyone expects her to do very well!

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:08.180
Failing would be like betraying everyone.

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:09.540
No!

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.860
Oh, there she is!

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:32.570
Doesn't something seem off?

00:21:32.570 --> 00:21:34.690
Do you think she's nervous?

00:21:34.690 --> 00:21:37.210
Even though we taught her all that stuff yesterday?

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:38.440
Let's check on her.

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.290
Yeah.

00:21:43.870 --> 00:21:46.020
Snoppe.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:47.190
Snoppe!

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:49.210
Where'd you go, Snoppe?

00:21:52.060 --> 00:21:54.820
What wonderful power.

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:01.230
It's useless.

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:04.530
I can't do anything.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.890
Unless the world ends, I'll always

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:44.660
love you!  Yeah, you!

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:48.130
'Cause I just love, love, love you!

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:52.860
Sure, I might struggle, but I'm still living.

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.540
So figure it out already! Yeah, you!

00:22:55.540 --> 00:22:59.180
Even though I love, love, love you,

00:22:59.880 --> 00:23:05.370
I wanna say it but, shoot, I just can't!

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.490
I wanna show you what's in my heart!

00:23:09.490 --> 00:23:12.920
Oh yes! You're my one true hero.

00:23:12.920 --> 00:23:18.080
Being in love's gonna be a bumpy ride.

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:24.010
But keep going! Okay, greenhorn rider?

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:29.260
Straight down the path, into the sunset, stronger and stronger.

00:23:29.260 --> 00:23:38.130
Ride through the wild land of youth.

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:52.130
That's how Snoppe was born.

00:23:52.130 --> 00:23:54.070
But now she's missing!

00:23:54.070 --> 00:23:57.890
Where'd she go? Mifuyu-chan's lost all of her confidence.

00:23:57.890 --> 00:24:00.560
Anyway, we have to find Snoppe!

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:03.230
All right. Snoppe search party, move out!

00:24:03.230 --> 00:24:05.210
Um, Hinamori-senpai?

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:07.390
Actually, I saw an egg...

00:24:07.390 --> 00:24:10.310
Seriously?  Wait, why are you even here?

00:24:10.310 --> 00:24:14.490
Next time on Shugo Chara: Battle in the Snow! Save Snoppe!

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:16.530
No way, an X Character appears?

00:24:16.530 --> 00:24:18.380
I wonder if we can be friends.

00:24:18.380 --> 00:24:20.020
You can't!
